  "asserted_semantics": [
    "A slot payload is verbatim JSON-object text with a positive version; a malformed payload, empty object or zero version is an extension refusal.",
    "Reading merges base slots with the command's staged values; a cleared slot is absent, not null.",
    "Writing a slot is a source write like placement/attributes/label/layer, so two write kinds on one object in one command conflict.",
    "An object created by the same command cannot be tagged yet; its inserted record is stamped once.",
    "Undo restores the previous slot value or removes the slot."
